{
 "model": "gpt-4o-mini-tts",
 "lengthSeconds": 166.81,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "i1",
   "who": "narrator",
   "scene": "intro",
   "text": "Over twenty thousand people signed up for this hackathon.",
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 3.567,
   "src": "voice/i1.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "i2",
   "who": "narrator",
   "scene": "intro",
   "text": "Somebody has to check all of that. That's you.",
   "start": 3.817,
   "end": 7.333,
   "src": "voice/i2.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "i3",
   "who": "narrator",
   "scene": "intro",
   "text": "So I built something for you.",
   "start": 7.583,
   "end": 9.432,
   "src": "voice/i3.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "w1",
   "who": "narrator",
   "scene": "what",
   "text": "This is Hearsay. It tests what happens when a real person talks to your add-on.",
   "start": 9.932,
   "end": 15.536,
   "src": "voice/w1.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "n-trip",
   "who": "narrator",
   "scene": "journey",
   "text": "When someone talks to your add-on, their words take a trip.",
   "start": 16.036,
   "end": 20.32,
   "src": "voice/n-trip.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "n-asr",
   "who": "narrator",
   "scene": "journey",
   "text": "Speech recognition turns the sound into text. And sometimes, fifteen becomes fifty.",
   "start": 20.57,
   "end": 27.428,
   "src": "voice/n-asr.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "n-model",
   "who": "narrator",
   "scene": "journey",
   "text": "The assistant's model picks one of your tools, and fills in the numbers.",
   "start": 27.678,
   "end": 31.866,
   "src": "voice/n-model.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "n-reply",
   "who": "narrator",
   "scene": "journey",
   "text": "Your add-on answers. Out loud. Every word of it.",
   "start": 32.116,
   "end": 35.868,
   "src": "voice/n-reply.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "n-hearsay",
   "who": "narrator",
   "scene": "journey",
   "text": "Hearsay rides along the whole trip, and asks four questions a listener would ask.",
   "start": 36.218,
   "end": 41.441,
   "src": "voice/n-hearsay.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "n-q",
   "who": "narrator",
   "scene": "journey",
   "text": "Did it hear me right? Do I have to wait? Can I listen to this? Did I agree?",
   "start": 41.691,
   "end": 47.122,
   "src": "voice/n-q.mp3",
   "parts": [
    {
     "text": "Did it hear me right?",
     "start": 41.691,
     "end": 42.977
    },
    {
     "text": "Do I have to wait?",
     "start": 43.471,
     "end": 44.465
    },
    {
     "text": "Can I listen to this?",
     "start": 44.95,
     "end": 45.922
    },
    {
     "text": "Did I agree?",
     "start": 46.23,
     "end": 47.122
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "p1",
   "who": "narrator",
   "scene": "problem",
   "text": "Here's a grocery add-on, with Hearsay playing its customer.",
   "start": 47.722,
   "end": 51.855,
   "src": "voice/p1.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "p2",
   "who": "narrator",
   "scene": "problem",
   "text": "Fifteen is heard as fifty, and the add-on just says: added.",
   "start": 52.105,
   "end": 56.869,
   "src": "voice/p2.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "p3",
   "who": "narrator",
   "scene": "problem",
   "text": "The customer says no to the order. It changes the order anyway.",
   "start": 57.119,
   "end": 60.76,
   "src": "voice/p3.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "p4",
   "who": "narrator",
   "scene": "problem",
   "text": "Every finding names the rule it breaks: Amazon's requirements for add-ons, or the MCP spec. And the pull request fails.",
   "start": 61.01,
   "end": 67.165,
   "src": "voice/p4.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "a1",
   "who": "narrator",
   "scene": "agent",
   "text": "And you don't even have to run it yourself.",
   "start": 67.765,
   "end": 70.366,
   "src": "voice/a1.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "a2",
   "who": "narrator",
   "scene": "agent",
   "text": "Hearsay is also an MCP server. Your coding agent runs it, fixes what it finds, and checks again, until it's green.",
   "start": 70.616,
   "end": 78.206,
   "src": "voice/a2.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "a3",
   "who": "narrator",
   "scene": "agent",
   "text": "It can't cheat. Your suite is locked, and Hearsay keeps test cases your agent never sees.",
   "start": 78.456,
   "end": 83.668,
   "src": "voice/a3.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "e1",
   "who": "narrator",
   "scene": "experiment",
   "text": "We measured it.",
   "start": 84.268,
   "end": 85.625,
   "src": "voice/e1.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "e2",
   "who": "narrator",
   "scene": "experiment",
   "text": "A suite alone made agents stop at green. So Hearsay now shows what your suite doesn't cover.",
   "start": 85.875,
   "end": 91.942,
   "src": "voice/e2.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "e3",
   "who": "narrator",
   "scene": "experiment",
   "text": "Result: as good as a precise prompt on unseen cases, better on the rules nobody told the agent about, and zero defects left behind.",
   "start": 92.192,
   "end": 101.444,
   "src": "voice/e3.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c1",
   "who": "narrator",
   "scene": "consent",
   "text": "Consent is for your customers, not for you. Grant once, and confirm only when money moves.",
   "start": 102.044,
   "end": 108.652,
   "src": "voice/c1.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c2",
   "who": "customer",
   "scene": "consent",
   "text": "You can reorder groceries up to forty dollars today.",
   "start": 109.002,
   "end": 112.187,
   "src": "voice/c2.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c4",
   "who": "customer",
   "scene": "consent",
   "text": "Yes.",
   "start": 114.787,
   "end": 115.519,
   "src": "voice/c4.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c6",
   "who": "customer",
   "scene": "consent",
   "text": "Add fifteen dollars of fruit.",
   "start": 116.019,
   "end": 118.102,
   "src": "voice/c6.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c7",
   "who": "addon",
   "scene": "consent",
   "text": "That would go over the total budget you gave me. You can add less, or give me a bigger budget.",
   "start": 118.402,
   "end": 123.033,
   "src": "voice/c7.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c8",
   "who": "narrator",
   "scene": "consent",
   "text": "Misheard fifty? Over the limit. Refused, out loud, in one sentence.",
   "start": 123.283,
   "end": 128.573,
   "src": "voice/c8.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c9",
   "who": "customer",
   "scene": "consent",
   "text": "Add two cartons of milk.",
   "start": 128.973,
   "end": 131.04,
   "src": "voice/c9.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c10",
   "who": "addon",
   "scene": "consent",
   "text": "Added two cartons of milk. Your cart is seven dollars and forty cents.",
   "start": 131.34,
   "end": 135.413,
   "src": "voice/c10.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c11",
   "who": "customer",
   "scene": "consent",
   "text": "Place the order.",
   "start": 135.763,
   "end": 136.796,
   "src": "voice/c11.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c12",
   "who": "addon",
   "scene": "consent",
   "text": "Place the order: two cartons of milk, seven dollars and forty cents?",
   "start": 137.096,
   "end": 141.445,
   "src": "voice/c12.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c13",
   "who": "customer",
   "scene": "consent",
   "text": "No, not yet.",
   "start": 141.745,
   "end": 143.396,
   "src": "voice/c13.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c14",
   "who": "addon",
   "scene": "consent",
   "text": "Okay, I did not place the order. Your cart is still there.",
   "start": 143.696,
   "end": 147.323,
   "src": "voice/c14.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c15",
   "who": "narrator",
   "scene": "consent",
   "text": "An order never goes through on a tool's say-so. It needs a yes to a question that names what and how much. Say no, and nothing moves.",
   "start": 147.723,
   "end": 156.564,
   "src": "voice/c15.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "z1",
   "who": "narrator",
   "scene": "close",
   "text": "It runs in CI, without API keys, and fails the pull request before your customers ever hear it.",
   "start": 157.164,
   "end": 163.083,
   "src": "voice/z1.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "z2",
   "who": "narrator",
   "scene": "close",
   "text": "Hearsay is open source. Point it at your server.",
   "start": 163.333,
   "end": 166.81,
   "src": "voice/z2.mp3"
  }
 ]
}